msgid "An example is shown below:"
msgstr "示例如下："

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:250002
msgid "Create a parameter set and add `eps_ab` as additional information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:270002
msgid ""
"Add `eps_ab` as a derived parameter. In this case, the retrieved value is"
" the derived one:"
msgstr "创建一个参数集，并将 `eps_ab` 作为附加信息加入："

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:290002
msgid ""
"Add `eps_ab` directly as a basic parameter. In this case, the retrieved "
"value is the basic parameter value:"
msgstr ""
"将 `eps_ab` 添加为派生参数。此时读取到的值为派生值："

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:300002
#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:340002
msgid "0.400 \\in [-\\infty, \\infty]"
msgstr ""
"将 `eps_ab` 直接添加为基础参数。此时读取到的值为基础参数值："

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:310002
msgid ""
"Add `eps_ab` as a constrained parameter. In this case, the retrieved "
"value is the constrained one:"
msgstr ""
"将 `eps_ab` 添加为约束参数。此时读取到的值为约束值："

#: ../../source/tutorials/parameters.ipynb:330002
msgid ""
"After removing the constraint, the retrieved value becomes the basic "
"parameter value again:"
msgstr ""
"移除该约束后，读取到的值会再次变为基础参数值："

